FOR LOOPS

DNA:
    .Converts a DNA sequence to its complementary sequence.
    .Reads DNA string from user or predefined variable.
    .Uses for loop to check each nucleotide.
    .Generates complement: A↔T, C↔G.
    .Prints original and complementary DNA sequences.Converts a DNA sequence to its complementary sequence.
    .Reads DNA string from user or predefined variable.
    .Uses for loop to check each nucleotide.
    .Generates complement: A↔T, C↔G.
    .Prints original and complementary DNA sequences.

 LOTTERY NUMBER GENERATOR:
    .Generates a set of random lottery numbers.
    .Uses for loop to select multiple numbers.
    .Ensures numbers are within specified range.
    .Avoids duplicates.
    .Prints final lottery numbers.   

MAGIC SQUARE:
    .Creates an odd-order magic square (sum of rows, columns, diagonals same).
    .Uses for loops to fill numbers in correct positions.
    .Calculates positions based on Siamese method.

ZIG ZAG:
    .Prints numbers or symbols in a zig-zag pattern.
    .Uses nested for loops for rows and columns.
    .Alternates direction for each row.
    .Prints formatted pattern to console.


